{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §2.2.3, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.5 (open schema maps, incomplete entries, proposed)"
  description: "A schema may contribute an incomplete entry to the kernel's open namespace `meta`, and complete it by its path: `meta.code_list` writes `max_items` as 4, so `codes`, its completion, admits four elements."
